981
00:48:26.160 --> 00:48:26.340
Ready?

982
00:48:27.140 --> 00:48:28.820
You're going to hate this one.

983
00:48:28.960 --> 00:48:29.940
You're going to hate it.

984
00:48:30.740 --> 00:48:32.800
Get lost on purpose.

985
00:48:33.100 --> 00:48:33.580
Oh, my God.

